# interview_helper_mux

Local pipeline: long-form interview audio → shared analysis → operator picks **flow1** (full master), **flow2** (highlights), or **flow3** (show description). Specs live in **`docs/`**; prompts in **`docs/prompts/`** are authoritative for LLM copy.

---

## Build-out workflow (every code change)

Applies for the **entire** repository build-out (Waves 0–7). Details and acceptance live in docs — do not skip them.

1. Read **`docs/build-out/steps-forward.md`** — what to implement next; paste the **Agent prompt** for your backlog step (#0–#20) into Cursor Agent mode.
2. Read **`docs/build-out/ticket-specs.md`** — acceptance for your BUILD id(s).
3. Read **`docs/build-out/stage-registry.md`** + `docs/pipeline/<area>/README.md` for the stage you touch.
4. If adding/changing behavior: **`docs/prompts/`** + **`docs/cross-cutting/json-schemas/`** must stay in sync with code.
4b. LLM guidance program: when touching LLM stages, keep [llm-guidance-program.md](../../docs/cross-cutting/llm-guidance-program.md), [stage-quality-scorecard.md](../../docs/cross-cutting/stage-quality-scorecard.md), arbiter rubrics, `deterministic_lint.py`, `artifact_cross_validate.py`, `llm_preflight.py`, `attempt_budget.py`, `llm_flow_hardening.py`, `local_volley_framer.py`, `stage_guidance.py`, `placement_qa.py`, `prompt_examples.py`, and `llm_call_record.py` aligned.
5. Before marking a ticket done: **`docs/build-out/doc-maintenance.md`** + **`docs/build-out/testing-and-verification.md`**.
6. After shipping: update **`docs/build-out/README.md`** status, **`ticket-specs.md`** checkboxes, **`repository-map.md`** gap table.

**Navigation (deeper specs):** `AGENTS.md` read order · `docs/build-out/implementation-guide.md` (all phases) · `docs/INDEX.md` (hub).

**Doc ↔ code gaps:** Before claiming a path works end-to-end, check **`docs/build-out/repository-map.md`** (Known gaps). Do not tell operators a planned feature is shipped until that row is cleared.

